  {
   "id": "t_a35bbca66ec301369b67",
   "sourceHash": "a35bbca66ec301369b678356b716a46e0d6531dac88a68dddd75ddc559cfe26e",
   "text": "— Ayurvedisch consult, geplande therapieën en het maaltijdplan tijdens het verblijf worden naast de training gepresenteerd.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_aff0766a5290e117b843",
   "sourceHash": "aff0766a5290e117b8433c351bae7b7b23bed682b2369bd822d88a647cc58512",
   "text": "Beoordeling",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_11e82f05851a22f5b062",
   "sourceHash": "11e82f05851a22f5b062e0a4e22605644fc059826fe964adb3f1d1ba1dd2f812",
   "text": "— Instructeurs kunnen de sessies aanpassen nadat zij het comfort en de ervaring van de deelnemer hebben beoordeeld.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_89cba615ef1e4e92ae7d",
   "sourceHash": "89cba615ef1e4e92ae7d26d61d101a9be4054c63d248951798bea27d8455ae19",
   "text": "Kruidendrank",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_5679d305bf0cf35947e5",
   "sourceHash": "5679d305bf0cf35947e590fb8e812b312d40acecc705ab26420006311a706f9c",
   "text": "Het ontbijt kan bestaan uit gekookte havermout met fruit of een gestoomd groentegerecht.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_61ef933b20381cd545fb",
   "sourceHash": "61ef933b20381cd545fb00caeaca1ebd8354bef24f1bb627063eeafa483d6795",
   "text": "Er wordt water of thee met kruiden geserveerd.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_01c35c975de26111688d",
   "sourceHash": "01c35c975de26111688d90bce21b268982a34acc6ad5ff693294b2a99a00193a",
   "text": "Het avondeten kan bestaan uit groentesoep of kitchari, een mengsel van rijst en linzen.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6b4762394cf2b3dc790a",
   "sourceHash": "6b4762394cf2b3dc790a0fe541fc0a213fedccc1e9816245f9a79aebde9b966f",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]Home[[CLOSE_1]][[OPEN_2]]/[[CLOSE_2]][[OPEN_3]]Alle programma’s[[CLOSE_3]][[OPEN_4]]/[[CLOSE_4]][[OPEN_5]]Yoga- en meditatieprogramma’s[[CLOSE_5]][[OPEN_6]]/[[CLOSE_6]][[OPEN_7]]Vaiyaktika Yoga Sādhanā — Gepersonaliseerde yoga[[CLOSE_7]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_92c47fe54aa9fb48b958",
   "sourceHash": "92c47fe54aa9fb48b95844932aeb38990ea6252e127d7fb0ff6993ed913fa05a",
   "text": "Gepersonaliseerde yoga bij Kairali",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6ed696bb310d778594b3",
   "sourceHash": "6ed696bb310d778594b3c3d55144a6300fdfd07a2c21091b5f99fee0438c2c24",
   "text": "Een yogaprogramma dat rond u is opgebouwd. Beoefening, pranayama en meditatie, afgestemd op uw doelen na een beoordeling door een arts.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b8fbe45a5f56537b5f31",
   "sourceHash": "b8fbe45a5f56537b5f3125ef5668201c8abb5fa58e795f39bede0babfbf70e8b",
   "text": "Bespreek uw gepersonaliseerde yogaprogramma",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c914d3bbc818ee17e813",
   "sourceHash": "c914d3bbc818ee17e813e87e6d7d9a725ce15aec822042a00e487dd53ccec8f7",
   "text": "Vertel ons team over uw doelen en ervaring. Een beoordeling door een arts vormt de basis van uw plan. Informeer naar de huidige regelingen en tarieven voor uw beoogde verblijf.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c94d78431ae0cae4d6c6",
   "sourceHash": "c94d78431ae0cae4d6c67773e0a6f47375ae9cb24d0e032c8ba5608d21dc452d",
   "text": "Informeer naar gepersonaliseerde yoga",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8de9602176ea87a05b22",
   "sourceHash": "8de9602176ea87a05b22574654e1e28da6287a15254ab42bc5e309d3ae0093c9",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]Over[[CLOSE_1]] [[OPEN_2]]Beoefening[[CLOSE_2]] [[OPEN_3]]Veelgestelde vragen[[CLOSE_3]] [[OPEN_4]]Gerelateerde programma’s[[CLOSE_4]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_bb286ac96dc70b65ac0b",
   "sourceHash": "bb286ac96dc70b65ac0b44da66246d4cfc71c8edcb66e439178371a2dcf3d75d",
   "text": "Een yogaprogramma dat rond u is opgebouwd",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_14a9e2d8597a14e2c675",
   "sourceHash": "14a9e2d8597a14e2c6757be23b2fc1c996b22d219fd07430b47ccc5bab663429",
   "text": "Maak als onderdeel van uw beoefening kennis met yogahoudingen, ademhalingsoefeningen, meditatie en ontspanning.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_435df0fc2fdaece7efa4",
   "sourceHash": "435df0fc2fdaece7efa4ccb492108aff78d2d2f90241e07e97fba2da61ca2a40",
   "text": "Uw doelen en een beoordeling door een arts bepalen de invulling van het programma. Informeer naar de sessies, de duur en de regelingen voor uw beoogde verblijf.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_360f0afbc02145e2b3cc",
   "sourceHash": "360f0afbc02145e2b3cc0ba1a6e03627764c1f10a0e658c1fd15bfa63c1ae424",
   "text": "Tijd voor uw beoefening",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4bd0162b0baaa0075ee0",
   "sourceHash": "4bd0162b0baaa0075ee0e3351d17cb0e7c76912edd30b25d52e7ea6f02361d2d",
   "text": "Hoe wordt gepersonaliseerde yoga afgestemd op mijn niveau?",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_70b91296efc73b55360a",
   "sourceHash": "70b91296efc73b55360ac248514c3659da5a31f566c707663ac98d77703f79f8",
   "text": "Vertel het team over uw yoga-ervaring, uw doelen en eventuele beperkingen in mobiliteit of gezondheid. Bespreek de voorgestelde beoefening, het instructieniveau en de aanpassingen vóór de opname.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c7145243b1e2f8da9870",
   "sourceHash": "c7145243b1e2f8da9870b1df83aba71b05b980abae05fad441a6f0d7dc407213",
   "text": "Ontdek het gepersonaliseerde yogaprogramma van Kairali in Kerala. Beoefening, pranayama en meditatie afgestemd op uw doelen na beoordeling door een arts.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b88a920641614e8f6bb4",
   "sourceHash": "b88a920641614e8f6bb4c1c1af4269640375abc851a19af7a9339405ed94e5da",
   "text": "Gepersonaliseerd yogaprogramma in Kerala | Kairali",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_867b1823120be77dae98",
   "sourceHash": "867b1823120be77dae98a8f51a8cfc695fc2cb86d24c3a2746ba022397aab3d1",
   "text": "Een groep die buiten tussen de bomen yoga beoefent.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_5283be1e18b01610365d",
   "sourceHash": "5283be1e18b01610365d850ea0acecdef80f6ee462cd4ba73628de0eb3cb83ab",
   "text": "Een vrouw in een staande yogahouding.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_cccb753a6ad2dd4066df",
   "sourceHash": "cccb753a6ad2dd4066df77cac1944c02922910688ef252e7d72c799acdaa8c92",
